#tutor26
Major General Tyron Spirex
Caliban Strategic Centre
Secret Base 51

Dear &,

First of all, congratulations on this victory. I must
confess we were prepared for the worst. I admit it, you
have earned your stripes %.

Enough compliments and let's get back to work.

We have a problem at Fortunia, they are out of fuel.
I have already given orders to send refueling relief.

I am sending you over there to clear things up concerning
the base management.
But, be on your guard, the region is swarming with Katzars.
We have counted no less than three Katzar bases.

I count on you to clean this up, the local Littlestonian
resistance will help you.

Burn this message and spread out the ashes.